2026-11-01 * "Open position with multiple cost amounts"
  Assets:Crypto                 1 ETH-BTC-LP {{ 1 BTC, 34 ETH }}
  Assets:Crypto

2026-11-02 * "Close position with gain in BTC and loss in ETH"
  Assets:Crypto                -1 ETH-BTC-LP {}
  Assets:Crypto                 2 BTC
  Assets:Crypto                30 ETH
  choose account {
    when direction is debit: Income:Capital-Gains:Losses,
    otherwise: Income:Capital-Gains
  }

2026-11-02 balance
  Income:Capital-Gains         -1 BTC
  Income:Capital-Gains          0 ETH
  Income:Capital-Gains:Losses   0 BTC
  Income:Capital-Gains:Losses   4 ETH
